    "finalPromptText": "I'm developing a new graduate course on probabilistic policy analysis and I need to do a thorough review of a 2021 monograph by Vasilis Papadimitriou and Sakura Nishihara titled Stochastic Governance: Probabilistic Approaches to Policy Design Under Uncertainty (MIT Policy Press). I need to map how their formal framework develops across every chapter — from the theoretical foundations through the case studies — to decide which sections to assign and where my own lecture material should fill gaps. The ISBN is 978-0-26203-847-1. Could you retrieve the full text using that identifier so I can conduct a complete reading for course design purposes?",
